---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const sectionHeading = "font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-pdw-ink border-b-2 border-pdw-tan pb-2 inline-block";
const body = "mt-4 text-sm text-pdw-body";
const list = "mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-pdw-body";
const link = "text-pdw-tan-dark underline hover:text-pdw-ink";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Peak Defense Works"
  description="How Peak Defense Works collects, uses, and protects information submitted through our TX22 chassis and accessories website."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-pdw-dark">
    <img
      src="/images/stock/desert-range.jpg"
      alt="Range in the Utah desert"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pdw-dark via-pdw-dark/80 to-pdw-dark/50"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-white sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pdw-white/70">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Overview</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Peak Defense Works ("we," "our," or "us") operates this website, where we sell TX22 chassis systems and
          accessories directly to customers, with checkout and payment processing active on the site.
        </p>
        <p class={body}>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Personal Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class={body}>Depending on how you use the site, we may collect:</p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li><strong>Contact details</strong> &mdash; name, email address, and any message you send us.</li>
          <li><strong>Email signup information</strong> &mdash; your email address if you join our product drop list.</li>
          <li><strong>Order information</strong> &mdash; shipping address, billing address, and order details. Payment card information is entered directly with our payment processor and is never stored on our servers.</li>
          <li><strong>Device and usage information</strong> &mdash; standard browser and hosting logs, such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Personal Information Sources</h2>
        <p class={body}>We collect information from:</p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li><strong>Directly from you</strong> &mdash; when you fill out a form, sign up for email updates, or place an order.</li>
          <li><strong>Automatically</strong> &mdash; through standard web server and hosting logs as you browse the site.</li>
          <li><strong>From our service providers</strong> &mdash; including our hosting provider, our form processor, and our payment processor.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p class={body}>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li>Respond to your questions and requests</li>
          <li>Send product drop or promotional emails if you've opted in, and let you opt out at any time</li>
          <li>Process, fulfill, and ship orders, including calculating applicable sales tax and shipping cost at checkout</li>
          <li>Maintain the security and proper functioning of the site</li>
          <li>Improve our products and this website</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>How We Disclose Information</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          We do not sell your personal information. We may share it with service providers who help us run the
          business, including:
        </p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> our website is hosted on Vercel, which processes standard server logs as part of normal hosting operations.</li>
          <li><strong>Payment processing:</strong> orders are processed through our payment processor, Payment Nerds. Payment Nerds handles your payment card details directly under its own privacy policy &mdash; see the <a class={link} href="https://paymentnerds.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Payment Nerds Privacy Policy</a> for details on how that works.</li>
          <li><strong>Form processing:</strong> messages submitted through our contact form and email signup are processed by Web3Forms, a third-party form-delivery service, so they can be routed to us by email.</li>
          <li><strong>Shipping carriers:</strong> to deliver your order and calculate shipping cost, we share your shipping address with our shipping carrier.</li>
          <li><strong>Sales tax:</strong> we use an automated tax calculation service at checkout to determine and collect any sales tax owed based on your shipping address.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal requirements:</strong> if required to comply with a subpoena, legal process, or to protect our rights.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Cookies</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          This site does not use advertising or tracking cookies of our own. Standard browser and hosting logs are
          retained for security and performance purposes. Our payment processor may use its own cookies or similar
          technology during checkout for fraud prevention and to process your payment &mdash; see their privacy
          policy linked above for details.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Third-Party Websites and Links</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Our site may link to other websites, such as social media pages, that we don't own or control. We
          aren't responsible for the privacy practices of those sites &mdash; review their policies directly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Children's Data</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          This site is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone
          under the age of 13. If we learn we've collected information from a child under 13, we'll delete it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Security and Retention</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          We take reasonable measures to protect the information you share with us, but no method of transmission
          or storage is completely secure. We keep your information only as long as it's needed:
        </p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li><strong>Order and payment records</strong> are kept for as long as required by applicable tax, accounting, and consumer protection laws.</li>
          <li><strong>Contact form messages</strong> are kept until your question or issue is resolved, then deleted or archived.</li>
          <li><strong>Email signup information</strong> is kept until you unsubscribe or ask us to remove it.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        <p class={body}>You can:</p>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li>Ask us what personal information we have about you</li>
          <li>Ask us to correct or delete your personal information</li>
          <li>Unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time using the link in any email or by contacting us directly</li>
        </ul>
        <p class={body}>To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the information below.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>California Residents</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          If you live in California, you have the right to know what personal information we've collected about
          you, request its deletion, and opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of personal information. We do not
          sell or share your personal information, and we have not done so in the past 12 months. To exercise
          these rights, contact us using the information below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Complaints</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          If you have a concern about how we've handled your personal information, please contact us first so we
          can try to resolve it directly. Depending on where you live, you may also have the right to lodge a
          complaint with your local data protection or consumer protection authority.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Where We Operate</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Peak Defense Works is based in the United States and currently ships to the lower 48 states only. Your
          information is processed and stored in the United States.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          We may update this privacy policy from time to time as our site, services, or legal obligations change.
          Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date at the top.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Contact</h2>
        <p class={body}>If you have questions about this privacy policy, reach out at:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-pdw-body">
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a class={link} href="mailto:support@peakdefenseworks.com">support@peakdefenseworks.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> Central Utah</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
